/**

@page page_installation_with_apptainer Installation with Apptainer

Here we maintain Apptainer Definition Files for different compilers.
They reuse the Spack environments stored under `utilities/spack`.

## Build

At the moment, we do not host pre-built Apptainer containers on some cloud repository.
Therefore, anyone who is interested in using Apptainer needs to first build the container.
One alternative approach is to pull a Docker image from Dockerhub and then convert to Apptainer.
See the Apptainer documentation for details.
In our experience this only works for simple images.
There is no guarantee that this will work with our Docker images.
Therefore, we do not recommend it.

To build the Apptainer containers, execute the following commands in the Peano root directory.

```shell
apptainer build utilities/apptainer/gcc.sif utilities/apptainer/Apptainer.gcc
apptainer build utilities/apptainer/intel.sif utilities/apptainer/Apptainer.intel
apptainer build utilities/apptainer/nvidia.sif utilities/apptainer/Apptainer.nvidia
apptainer build utilities/apptainer/amd.sif utilities/apptainer/Apptainer.amd
apptainer build utilities/apptainer/llvm.sif utilities/apptainer/Apptainer.llvm
apptainer build utilities/apptainer/exahype2.sif utilities/apptainer/Apptainer.exahype2
```

## Usage

```shell
apptainer shell -e --bind "$PWD" utilities/apptainer/<compiler>.sif
```

### With GPU Support

```shell
apptainer shell --nv -e --bind "$PWD" utilities/apptainer/<compiler>.sif
apptainer shell --rocm -e --bind "$PWD" utilities/apptainer/<compiler>.sif
```

For more details, see
https://apptainer.org/docs/user/1.0/gpu.html

*/
